     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Mieć + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Mam zadzwonić do urzędu** means «I have to call the office». The construction **mieć + infinitive** expresses a plan or a planned task.",
      "**Do urzędu** indicates destination; **w urzędzie** indicates place. The preposition changes the case."
     ],
